{"tool_name":"cellsnp-lite","contents":["biocontainers","bioschemas","biotools","bioconda","oeb"],"fetched_metadata":{"bioconda":{"name":"cellsnp-lite","version":"1.2.3","home":"https://github.com/single-cell-genetics/cellsnp-lite","documentation":"https://cellsnp-lite.readthedocs.io/en/latest","license":"Apache-2.0","summary":"Efficient genotyping bi-allelic SNPs on single cells.","identifiers":["doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btab358","biotools:cellsnp-lite"],"license_file":"LICENSE","build":{"number":6,"run_exports":[null]},"requirements":{"build":["make",null,"autoconf","automake","libtool","pkg-config"],"host":["htslib","libcurl","xz","bzip2","zlib"],"run":["htslib"]},"source_url":"https://github.com/single-cell-genetics/cellsnp-lite/archive/aad18644adcde853c313362a856a24245c9b91f7.tar.gz","test":{"commands":["cellsnp-lite 2>&1 | grep -i 'options'"]}},"biocontainers":{"name":"cellsnp-lite","identifiers":["doi:10.1101/2020.12.31.424913"],"license":"Apache-2.0","summary":"Efficient genotyping bi-allelic SNPs on single cells","home_url":"https://github.com/single-cell-genetics/cellsnp-lite","keywords":["RNA-Seq","Genetics"],"manually_check":true,"total_pulls":6763},"biotools":{"id":"cellsnp-lite","home":"https://github.com/single-cell-genetics/cellsnp-lite","license":"Apache-2.0","summary":"cellsnp-lite is an efficient tool for genotyping single cells. cellsnp-lite was initially designed to pileup the expressed alleles in single-cell or bulk RNA-seq data, which can be directly used for donor deconvolution in multiplexed single-cell RNA-seq data, particularly with vireo, which assigns cells to donors and detects doublets, even without genotyping reference. Now besides RNA-seq data, cellsnp-lite could also be applied on DNA-seq and ATAC-seq data, either in bulk or single-cell.","addition_date":"2021-03-19T08:40:26Z","last_update_date":"2021-04-22T13:57:28Z","biotools_curie":"biotools:cellsnp-lite","credit":[{"email":"yuanhua@hku.hk","name":"Yuanhua Huang","typeEntity":"